  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab\n2020-2026 2500 HD 3500 HD Crew Cab (Excl. 2019 1500 LD)\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: YITAMOTOR running boards are custom-fit for 2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab, 2020-2026 2500 HD 3500 HD Crew Cab (Excl. 2019 1500 LD). Check the fitment picture if you're unsure about your truck model\nStrong & Reliable Build: Made with stainless steel that outperforms ordinary steel in rust resistance and durability, these side steps support up to 450 lbs per side; Combined with tough ABS step pads, they provide lasting reliability for passengers, pets, and heavy gear\nEasy to Install: Bottom slider design allows forward or backward adjustment for better customization; Easily bolt on the step bars to your vehicle with no cutting or drilling needed\nAll-Weather Traction: 6-inch wide nerf bars with large honeycomb-patterned ABS surface ensure non-slip footing in rain, snow, or mud, making every entry and exit stable and secure\nRugged Protection: Step rails guard your truck's lower body from dings and scratches, while guarded ends prevent bumping knees and enhance the sleek, rugged look of your truck\nProfessional installation recommended",
